## Built to run anywhere
```visual
timeline: forge doctor | forge build | forge chat | forge eval | forge regress | forge replay | forge ui
at: 7
```
- Windows, macOS, Linux; Python 3.10+; two dependencies; 27 tests including an offline end-to-end run
- Soft time budget, resumable runs, and a replay of any committed run with no model installed

## In one sentence
```visual
quote: Never believe a small model until code has checked it. That is how a factory made of imperfect parts ships an agent you can trust.
```
